==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns as the boss after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] can handle the Heavenly Hippoe on its own, and provided you have all the anti-Alien Treasures, Hyppoh will be easy to deal with. To deal with Shy Boy, use [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island]]/[[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale]] or [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]].

